msgid "Departments"
msgstr "Servicer"

msgid "Department pages"
msgstr "Säite vun de Servicer"

msgid "Department page"
msgstr "Säit vun engem Service"

msgid "Department editor"
msgstr "Redakter vun engem Service"

msgid "Add a department"
msgstr "E Service derbäisetzen"

msgid "Pages of the departments: presentation, links, contacts and editors."
msgstr "Säite vun de Servicer: Presentatioun, Linken, Kontakter a Redakteren."

msgid "Each department presents its work, its tools and the colleagues to contact."
msgstr "All Service stellt hei seng Aarbecht, seng Tools an d'Kolleegen vir, déi een uruffe kann."

msgid "Not published"
msgstr "Net publizéiert"

msgid "No department page yet."
msgstr "Nach keng Säit vun engem Service."

msgid "Links"
msgstr "Linken"

msgid "Contacts"
msgstr "Kontakter"

msgid "Phone"
msgstr "Telefon"

msgid "Mobile"
msgstr "GSM"

msgid "E-mail"
msgstr "E-Mail"

msgid "Building"
msgstr "Gebai"

msgid "(opens in a new tab)"
msgstr "(geet an engem neien Tab op)"

msgid "Edit links and contacts"
msgstr "Linken a Kontakter änneren"

msgid "Links and contacts"
msgstr "Linken a Kontakter"

msgid "Own page"
msgstr "Eege Säit"

msgid "Department"
msgstr "Service"

msgid "Page"
msgstr "Säit"

msgid "Editors"
msgstr "Redakteren"

msgid "No department yet."
msgstr "Nach kee Service."

msgid "Each department has a page with its presentation, links and contacts. To choose the editors of a department, tick it on their account (People, Edit, “Departments edited”)."
msgstr "All Service huet eng Säit mat senger Presentatioun, senge Linken a senge Kontakter. Fir d'Redakteren vun engem Service ze bestëmmen, kräizt de Service op hirem Kont un (Benotzer, Änneren, „Servicer, déi een ännert“)."

msgid "The departments you can edit: presentation, links and contacts."
msgstr "D'Servicer, déi Dir ännere kënnt: Presentatioun, Linken a Kontakter."

msgid "Section"
msgstr "Rubrik"

msgid "You can change the presentation, the links and the contacts. The name, the address and the order of the department are set by an administrator."
msgstr "Dir kënnt d'Presentatioun, d'Linken an d'Kontakter änneren. Den Numm, d'Adress an d'Reiefolleg vum Service setzt en Administrateur fest."

msgid "Contact not found in the staff directory: not shown on the page. Choose another colleague or empty the field."
msgstr "Kontakt net am Personalverzeechnes fonnt: e gëtt net op der Säit gewisen. Wielt en anere Kolleeg oder maacht d'Feld eidel."

msgid "Colleague"
msgstr "Kolleeg"

msgid "Role (optional)"
msgstr "Roll (fräiwëlleg)"

msgid "e.g. Head of department"
msgstr "z. B. Chef de service"

msgid "Choose the colleague in the list that appears while you type."
msgstr "Wielt de Kolleeg an der Lëscht, déi beim Tippen opgeet."

msgid "Presentation"
msgstr "Presentatioun"

msgid "What the department does and how it can help colleagues."
msgstr "Wat de Service mécht a wéi en de Kolleegen hëllefe kann."

msgid "Tools, documents and websites of the department. Drag the lines to change the order."
msgstr "Tools, Dokumenter a Websäite vum Service. Zitt d'Zeilen, fir d'Reiefolleg z'änneren."

msgid "Type a name and choose the colleague in the staff directory list. The phone numbers and e-mail come from the directory."
msgstr "Tippt en Numm a wielt de Kolleeg an der Lëscht vum Personalverzeechnes. Telefonsnummeren an E-Mail kommen aus dem Verzeechnes."

msgid "Department e-mail"
msgstr "E-Mail vum Service"

msgid "Shared mailbox of the department, shown above the contacts."
msgstr "Gemeinsam Mailbox vum Service, iwwer de Kontakter gewisen."

msgid "Department phone"
msgstr "Telefon vum Service"

msgid "Main number of the department, shown above the contacts."
msgstr "Haaptnummer vum Service, iwwer de Kontakter gewisen."

msgid "Existing section"
msgstr "Bestoend Rubrik"

msgid "Only for Human resources, Communication and IT guides: the links and contacts are shown at the bottom of that page."
msgstr "Nëmme fir Personalservice, Kommunikatiounsservice an IT-Uleedungen: d'Linken an d'Kontakter ginn ënnen op där Säit gewisen."

msgid "Order"
msgstr "Reiefolleg"

msgid "Position in the list of departments: smaller numbers come first."
msgstr "Plaz an der Lëscht vun de Servicer: déi kleng Zuelen kommen als éischt."

msgid "Departments edited"
msgstr "Servicer, déi een ännert"

msgid "The person can edit the presentation, links and contacts of these departments only (D-007). Set by an administrator."
msgstr "D'Persoun kann d'Presentatioun, d'Linken an d'Kontakter nëmme vun dëse Servicer änneren (D-007). Gëtt vun engem Administrateur festgeluecht."

msgid "Page of a department: presentation, links and contacts (US-22 to US-28)."
msgstr "Säit vun engem Service: Presentatioun, Linken a Kontakter (US-22 bis US-28)."

msgid "- All my sections -"
msgstr "- All meng Rubriken -"

msgid "Title contains"
msgstr "Titel enthält"

msgid "Filter"
msgstr "Filteren"

msgid "Reset"
msgstr "Zrécksetzen"

msgid "No content matches these filters."
msgstr "Keen Inhalt entsprécht dëse Filteren."

msgid "Unpublished"
msgstr "Net publizéiert"

msgid "Published"
msgstr "Publizéiert"

msgid "Published status"
msgstr "Status"

msgid "News"
msgstr "Neiegkeeten"

msgid "No news at the moment."
msgstr "Am Moment keng Neiegkeeten."

msgid "Add news"
msgstr "Eng Neiegkeet derbäisetzen"

msgid "Read more"
msgstr "Méi liesen"

msgid "Translation not available"
msgstr "Iwwersetzung net disponibel"

msgid "Department news"
msgstr "Neiegkeet vun engem Service"

msgid "News published by a department on its page, for example recent IT security publications (150 words at most, D-031)."
msgstr "Neiegkeet, déi e Service op senger Säit publizéiert, zum Beispill rezent Publikatiounen iwwer IT-Sécherheet (maximal 150 Wierder, D-031)."

msgid "The news appears on the page of this department."
msgstr "D'Neiegkeet gëtt op der Säit vun dësem Service gewisen."

msgid "Text"
msgstr "Text"

msgid "150 words at most (D-031)."
msgstr "Maximal 150 Wierder (D-031)."

msgid "Optional. Link to the full publication, for example a GOVCERT.LU alert or a document."
msgstr "Fräiwëlleg. Link op déi ganz Publikatioun, zum Beispill eng Alerte vu GOVCERT.LU oder en Dokument."

msgid "End of publication"
msgstr "Enn vun der Publikatioun"

msgid "Optional. From the day after this date, the news no longer appears on the department page."
msgstr "Fräiwëlleg. Vum Dag no dësem Datum un gëtt d'Neiegkeet net méi op der Säit vum Service gewisen."

msgid "The text has @mots words; the maximum is 150 (D-031)."
msgstr "Den Text huet @mots Wierder; de Maximum ass 150 (D-031)."

msgid "You can only publish news for the departments you edit."
msgstr "Dir kënnt nëmme Neiegkeete fir d'Servicer publizéieren, déi Dir ännert."
